Package: descriptiveStats
Title: Calculate Descriptive Statistics for Numeric Vectors.
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Georgia", "Goddard", , "glgoddard@hotmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A package that calculates multiple descriptive statistics values through individual functions. Values include: mean, median, mode, first quartile (Q1), third quartile (Q3), and interquartile range (IQR = Q3 - Q1). Users input the data and the calc_{...} function does the calculation.
